"><div class=3D"eq__num">Question 1 of 100</div><div class=3D"eq__q"><p>You=
 are the architect for Fabrikam publishers who are looking to move to Azure=
 as their cloud platform of choice. Fabrikam has 2 subscriptions with the f=
