is application should also not leave the data center its deployed in due to=
 regulatory compliance reasons.<br>
Requirement 3: You need to plan for availability for the =E2=80=9CHR=E2=80=
=9D system in the event that the data center where the application VM is de=
ployed goes down, the application will continue functioning.<br>
Which of the following options should be part of the solution for requireme=
nt 2?</p></div><div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-locked"><span class=3D"eq__mar=
k">A</span><span>Availability Zone</span></div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-sel=
ected is-locked is-wrong"><span class=3D"eq__mark">=E2=9C=97</span><span>Av=
ailability Set with Fault Domain</span></div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-locke=
