tor role encompasses the ability to create, update, and delete resources, m=
aking it suitable for managing the project's infrastructure components with=
out the risk of altering user access controls. This role adheres to the pri=
nciple of least privilege, granting only the necessary permissions to perfo=
rm the required tasks.</p>
