<p><b>Correct answer: Azure Queue storage</b></p>
<p>Azure Queue Storage provides a reliable messaging service for asynchrono=
us communication between application components. In this scenario, differen=
t cloud services (order processing, billing, payment, etc.) need to communi=
cate transaction information without direct, synchronous dependencies. Azur=
e Queue Storage allows these services to enqueue messages representing tran=
saction updates or requests. Other services can then dequeue and process th=
ese messages at their own pace. This decouples the services, improving scal=
ability and resilience. The REST API allows easy integration with various c=
loud services.</p>
<br><br>
<p><b>Incorrect:</b></p>
<p><b>A. Traffic Manager</b> - Traffic Manager is a DNS-based traffic load =
