 routing methods (e.g., priority, performance). It's not designed for async=
hronous message queuing or inter-service communication of transaction data.=
</p>
<p><b>B. Azure Notification Hubs</b> - Azure Notification Hubs is a mobile =
push notification engine. It's used to send push notifications to mobile de=
vices. It's not suitable for general-purpose asynchronous communication bet=
ween cloud services for transaction processing.</p>
<p><b>C. Azure Blob storage</b> - Azure Blob storage is object storage for =
unstructured data. While services could theoretically use Blob storage to e=
xchange data, it's not designed for asynchronous messaging. Using Blob stor=
age for this purpose would require complex polling and coordination logic, =
making it less efficient and reliable than Azure Queue Storage.</p>
