<p><b>Correct answer: Notification Hub</b></p>
<p>Notification Hubs provide a scalable mobile push notification engine for=
 sending millions of push notifications to Android, iOS, Windows, and other=
 platforms. It supports various authentication methods, including Shared Ac=
cess Signatures (SAS), which aligns with the requirement of using shared ac=
cess secrets. Notification Hubs abstract the complexities of platform-speci=
fic push notification services (like APNS for iOS, FCM for Android, and WNS=
 for Windows) and provide a unified interface for sending notifications to =
all supported platforms. This makes it the ideal choice for sending promoti=
onal content to millions of devices across different platforms.</p>
