<p><b>Correct answer: Data Box offline transfer</b></p>
<p>Data Box offline transfer is the fastest, most reliable, and secure way =
to transfer 70 TB of data to an on-premises backup server with a limited in=
ternet connection (200 Mbps) within 30 days. Transferring 70 TB of data ove=
