<p><b>Correct answer: Azure Storage Accounts</b></p>
<p>Azure Storage Accounts are a versatile and cost-effective solution for v=
arious data storage needs, including archive-based documents. Azure Storage=
 offers different tiers: Hot, Cool, and Archive. The Archive tier is specif=
ically designed for data that is rarely accessed and can tolerate retrieval=
 latencies of several hours. This makes it ideal for long-term storage of d=
ocuments where immediate access is not required, significantly reducing sto=
rage costs compared to Hot or Cool tiers. Azure Storage also offers feature=
s like lifecycle management policies to automatically move data to the Arch=
ive tier based on age, further optimizing costs.</p>
