ocuments, it's not optimized for long-term archival storage and is signific=
antly more expensive than Azure Storage for this purpose. Cosmos DB is not =
a cost-effective solution for archive-based documents.</p>
<p><b>B. Azure SQL Database</b> - Azure SQL Database is a relational databa=
se service suitable for structured data and transactional workloads. It is =
