u could store file paths or metadata related to the documents in SQL Databa=
se, storing the actual documents within the database would be inefficient a=
nd costly compared to using Azure Storage. SQL Database is optimized for qu=
erying and managing structured data, not for storing large, infrequently ac=
cessed files.</p>
<p><b>D. Azure SQL Datawarehouse</b> - Azure SQL Datawarehouse (now Azure S=
ynapse Analytics dedicated SQL pool) is a data warehousing solution designe=
d for large-scale analytics and reporting. It is not optimized for storing =
