st data into Azure, it's not designed for general-purpose file transfer or =
periodic bulk data uploads. Event Hubs is more suitable for scenarios like =
telemetry data, clickstream analysis, or IoT device data, not for transferr=
ing files to a storage account.</p>
<p><b>D. SQL Elastic Pools</b> - SQL Elastic Pools are a cost-effective sol=
