p>
<p>This is the correct answer because the requirement is to backup SQL Serv=
er data running on Azure VMs and to only backup the data that has changed s=
ince the last full backup. The "SQL Server in Azure VM" policy type is spec=
ifically designed for backing up SQL Server workloads running inside Azure =
VMs. Differential backups capture the changes made since the last full back=
up, which aligns with the requirement to only backup changed data. This app=
roach reduces backup size and time compared to always performing full backu=
ps.</p>
<br><br>
<p><b>Incorrect:</b></p>
<p><b>A. Azure Virtual Machine policy - &gt; Differential backup</b> - This=
