fective to implement?</p></div><div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-locked"><span =
class=3D"eq__mark">A</span><span>Internal load balancer</span></div><div cl=
ass=3D"eq__opt is-selected is-locked is-wrong"><span class=3D"eq__mark">=E2=
=9C=97</span><span>Availability set</span></div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-lo=
cked is-correct"><span class=3D"eq__mark">=E2=9C=93</span><span>Virtual Mac=
hine Scale Set (VMSS)</span></div><div class=3D"eq__opt is-locked"><span cl=
