<p><b>Correct answer: Azure Privileged Identity Management (PIM)</b></p>
<p>Azure Privileged Identity Management (PIM) is the correct solution for r=
equirement 5, which states: "Ensure users assigned RBAC permission to resou=
rces are reviewed on a regular basis to minimize stale role assignments." P=
IM allows you to manage, control, and monitor access to important resources=
 in your organization. A key feature of PIM is access reviews, which enable=
 you to periodically review user role assignments to ensure that users stil=
l require the access they have been granted. This helps to minimize the ris=
k of stale or unnecessary role assignments, improving security and complian=
ce. PIM provides reporting and auditing capabilities to track role activati=
ons and access reviews.</p>
