ike "examcertlab-app," especially when specific performance and monitoring =
requirements are in place. Elastic pools are more cost-effective when you h=
ave multiple databases that can share resources, but for a single database,=
 a dedicated vCore-based instance offers better control and predictability.=
</p>
<p><b>B. A Virtual machine running a SQL server</b> - While this is a viabl=
