<p><b>Correct answer: Transparent data encryption</b></p>
<p>Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) encrypts SQL Server, Azure SQL Databas=
e, and Azure Synapse Analytics data at rest, protecting the data and log fi=
les. TDE performs real-time I/O encryption and decryption of the data, prov=
iding encryption at rest without requiring changes to the application. Give=
n the requirement to encrypt data at rest for the SQL Server database and t=
he need to minimize management overhead by using Azure managed services whe=
rever possible, TDE is the most suitable solution. It integrates seamlessly=
 with Azure Key Vault for key management, fulfilling the requirement that o=
nly the front and middle tiers should have access to the encryption keys (v=
ia managed identities). TDE addresses the encryption at rest requirement di=
rectly and efficiently.</p>
<br><br>
<p><b>Incorrect:</b></p>
<p><b>B. Always Encrypted</b> - Always Encrypted protects sensitive data, s=
uch as credit card numbers or national identification numbers (for example,=
