atabase backups for 5 years. Geo-replication focuses on near real-time data=
 replication, not long-term archival.</p>
<p><b>D. Configure Azure backup for the database</b> - Azure Backup can be =
used to back up Azure SQL databases, but it typically offers shorter retent=
ion periods compared to Long-Term Retention (LTR). While Azure Backup is a =
valid backup solution, LTR is more suitable when a specific long-term reten=
tion period (like 5 years) is required, as it is designed and priced for th=
is scenario.</p>
